# Founder's Note 0001 — Clarity Over Cleverness

## Observation

We will never sacrifice clarity for cleverness.

We choose simple over impressive.

We choose understanding over complexity.

We choose engineering over appearance.

## Honest Inspection

Ask:

**"Would an engineer unfamiliar with this project understand this without additional explanation?"**

If the answer is **no**, then the design, code, or documentation should be refined until clarity becomes the natural result.

## Measure of Success

If a future engineer can understand our work without knowing us, then we have succeeded.

